[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3289089921","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4062#issuecomment-3289089921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4062","id":3289089921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM7EC4eB","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-14T02:07:11Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T02:07:11Z","body":"@mscossy \n\nIn this situation, Open5GS removes the UE context internally when the implicit detach timer expires during paging.\nBecause the UE context no longer exists, the MME cannot send a Downlink Data Notification ACK.\nUnless there is a specification requirement that the UE context must be kept even after implicit detach during paging, I plan to keep the current behavior.\n\nPlease let me know if you have any different opinions.\n\nThanks a lot!\nSukchan","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3289089921/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3306263998","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4062#issuecomment-3306263998","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4062","id":3306263998,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM7FEZW-","user":{"login":"mscossy","id":85286538,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Mjg2NTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85286538?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy","html_url":"https://github.com/mscossy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mscossy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T08:39:00Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T08:39:59Z","body":"@acetcom \nAccording to 3GPP TS 23.401   5.3.4.3 Network Triggered Service Request, I think MME shall send Downlink Data Notification ACK when paging failure. Because S-GW does not know how long it should continue paging.\n\n 5.3.4.3 Network Triggered Service Request\nIf the MME and/or SGSN receives no response from the UE after this paging repetition procedure, it shall use the Downlink Data Notification Reject message to notify the Serving GW about the paging failure, if paging was triggered by a Downlink Data Notification message, unless the MME or SGSN is aware of an ongoing MM procedure that prevents the UE from responding, i.e. the MME or SGSN received a Context Request message indicating that the UE performs TAU or RAU procedure with another MME or SGSN.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3306263998/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3315875319","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4062#issuecomment-3315875319","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4062","id":3315875319,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM7FpD33","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T09:31:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T09:31:17Z","body":"@mscossy \n\nThe fix has been merged into the main branch.\nAs you mentioned, the SGW-C also has its own timer for DDN handling, and per 29.274 §7.6 the GTP-C messages already have a reliable delivery mechanism.\n\nHowever, to reduce unnecessary retransmissions we decided to implement this handling in the MME as well. Please give it a try, and let us know if you encounter any further issues during your testing.\n\nThanks a lot!\nSukchan","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3315875319/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3429808529","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4062#issuecomment-3429808529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4062","id":3429808529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM7MbrmR","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T22:35:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T22:35:00Z","body":"This issue has been closed automatically due to lack of activity. This has been done to try and reduce 